        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Luck &amp; Loot</i></strong> is a fast-paced <strong>dice-builder roguelike</strong> where strategy and chaos collide. Forge <strong>custom dice</strong>, harness <strong>wild loot synergies</strong>, and dive into the <strong>cursed realms </strong>of Eldralith; each run a new roll of fate. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outsmart brutal foes in<strong> turn-based combat</strong>, embrace high-risk modifiers, and uncover dark secrets in a world trapped in cycle. <strong>Victory changes you.</strong> <strong>So does failure.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208110/extras/bb9cf5a70ce23f543c4abc5a2da581ce.poster.avif?t=1789119215\" width=616 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208110/extras/bb9cf5a70ce23f543c4abc5a2da581ce.webm?t=1789119215\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208110/extras/bb9cf5a70ce23f543c4abc5a2da581ce.mp4?t=1789119215\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Dialogue hits as hard as the dice in this pixel-powered showdown.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Nostalgic Roguelike With A Dice Building Twist</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as one of three heroes, each haunted, each hunting meaning. <strong>Customize your dice with powerful, swappable faces</strong> as you forge the perfect build through each high-stakes run. Every choice counts. <strong>Every roll is a risk</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208110/extras/b7a88a49c9611adb03a19e4a5df45126.poster.avif?t=1789119215\" width=616 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208110/extras/b7a88a49c9611adb03a19e4a5df45126.webm?t=1789119215\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208110/extras/b7a88a49c9611adb03a19e4a5df45126.mp4?t=1789119215\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Every face is a choice—build your dice, shape your fate.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dynamic Dice Building</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge your strategy with <strong>interchangeable, upgradeable dice faces</strong> that define your power—and your fate. <strong>Sacrifice weaker sides to unlock potent traits</strong>, and <strong>adapt your build on the fly</strong> as the dangers of Eldralith deepen. But choose carefully: <strong>each die holds only so much power</strong>, and every decision edges you closer to mastery… <strong>or ruin</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208110/extras/79f9ca2b5d8de5ce0074eca52b86ef36.poster.avif?t=1789119215\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208110/extras/79f9ca2b5d8de5ce0074eca52b86ef36.webm?t=1789119215\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208110/extras/79f9ca2b5d8de5ce0074eca52b86ef36.mp4?t=1789119215\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Choose your curse in color—each palette a new shade of doom.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Pixel Peril &amp; Chiptune Charm</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Descend into a  <strong>dark fantasy where every pixel drips with dread </strong>and<strong> every chiptune echoes with myth</strong>. <strong><i>Luck &amp; Loot</i></strong> blends <strong>retro style</strong> with <strong>eldritch horror</strong>, inviting you to <strong>brave haunted forests, corrupted keeps, and cursed melodies</strong> alike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you break the cycle, <strong>or become one more echo in the void?</strong> The dice are cast. <strong>The fate is yours</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 Heroes with their own unique sets of dice faces</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 Ever customizable dice</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 Unique dungeons, each dominated by a formidable foe</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20+ Powerful dice upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >18+ Difficulty modifiers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >40+ Random events</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50+ Unique relics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >45+ Creature types and Bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >90+ Interchangeable and upgradeable dice faces</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endlessly Replayable</p></li></ul>",
