 with myth</strong>. <strong><i>Luck &amp; Loot</i></strong> blends <strong>retro style</strong> with <strong>eldritch horror</strong>, inviting you to <strong>brave haunted forests, corrupted keeps, and cursed melodies</strong> alike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you break the cycle, <strong>or become one more echo in the void?</strong> The dice are cast. <strong>The fate is yours</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 Heroes with their own unique sets of dice faces</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 Ever customizable dice</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 Unique dungeons, each dominated by a formidable foe</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20+ Powerful dice upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >18+ Difficulty modifiers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >40+ Random events</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50+ Unique relics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >45+ Creature types and Bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >90+ Interchangeable and upgradeable dice faces</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endlessly Replayable</p></li></ul>",
